# Dissection Practice: "Target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life. Up to one target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.
# Up to one target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn." All three targets are chosen: Bot2 loses 1 and Bot1 gains 1 (CR 119.3),
# Misshapen Fiend (1/1) becomes 2/2 and Ornithopter (0/2) becomes -1/1 - alive, since toughness 1 is above 0 (CR 704.5f) - so each
# creature slot did its own part to its own creature.

